
############################################
### 🔹 TESTS POUR MENU (menu_items)
############################################

### ➤ GET tous les plats
GET http://localhost:8000/menu


### ➤ POST Pizza Margherita
POST http://localhost:8000/menu
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pizza Margherita",
  "price": 45.0,
  "description": "Classique italienne",
  "image_url": "https://exemple.com/pizza.jpg"
}

### ➤ POST Coca Cola
POST http://localhost:8000/menu
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Coca cola",
  "price": 15.0,
  "description": "Coke",
  "image_url": "https://exemple.com/coca.jpg"
}



### ➤ DELETE un plat par ID
DELETE http://localhost:8000/menu/3



